     'how_en' => 'Yearly units = kW × units per kW per day × 365. Net yearly saving = yearly units × your rate − maintenance. Net cost = kW × cost per kW − subsidy. Payback = net cost ÷ net yearly saving. The 25-year figure ignores panel ageing and tariff rises.',
