     'how_en' => 'Usable space with equal drives: RAID 0 = n × size; RAID 1 = one drive\'s size (all mirrored); RAID 5 = (n − 1) × size; RAID 6 = (n − 2) × size; RAID 10 = n ÷ 2 × size. Formatted space will be a little lower.',
