     'how_en' => 'Frame time (ms) = 1000 ÷ refresh rate. Data rate ≈ width × height × Hz × bits per pixel × 1.08 (about 8% for blanking with reduced-blanking timings). Compared with usable link rates: HDMI 1.4 8.16, HDMI 2.0 14.4, DP 1.2 17.28, DP 1.4 25.92, HDMI 2.1 ≈ 42.6 Gbps.',
